# ── local-only state, not configuration ──────────────────────────

# Superseded Hyprland .conf setup, kept on disk purely as a local
# rollback for scripts/restore-conf.sh. Obsolete once Hyprland 0.57
# removes .conf support entirely, so not worth versioning.
hypr/conf.bak/
hypr/hyprland.lua.parked-*

# GTK4 theme files are symlinks into /usr/share/themes/… created by
# hand. They point at an absolute path that only exists once
# catppuccin-gtk-theme-mocha is installed, so committing them would
# just produce dangling links on a fresh machine. settings.ini IS
# tracked — that's the actual configuration.
gtk-4.0/gtk.css
gtk-4.0/gtk-dark.css
gtk-4.0/assets

# Editor / OS noise
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
